    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i know you're an ai but i can't really get hold of my doctor until monday and the pain is making it hard to sleep. i've taken advil before when i wasn't on the blood thinner and it was fine. i just need to know if there's like a low dose i can take just to get through the weekend without making things dangerous? like a standard 200mg dose or something?",
